<title>AUSTRALIA: Merrill Lynch to issue A$150 mln kangaroo bonds.</title>
<headline>Merrill Lynch to issue A$150 mln kangaroo bonds.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. investment bank Merrill Lynch and Co Inc will issue an A$150 million 2002 kangaroo bond into the Australian market at a coupon to be finalised on Thursday, the bank's Australian subsidiary said on Wednesday.</p>
</text>
